      "widgets_values": [
        "# LTX-2 Local Model Checklist (No Platform API)\n\nCore models you listed:\n- `ltx-2-19b-dev_Q4_K_M.gguf`\n- `ltx-2-19b-distilled_Q6_K.gguf`\n- `ltx-2-19b-dev-fp8_transformer_only.safetensors`\n\nCompanion files commonly required by this GGUF pipeline:\n- `gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors`\n- `ltx-2-19b-embeddings_connector_dev_bf16.safetensors`\n- `LTX2_video_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n- `LTX2_audio_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n- `ltx-2-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.0.safetensors`\n- `taeltx_2.safetensors`\n\nOptional LoRA loaders are bypassed by default for compatibility.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
