    {
      "id": 336,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1170,
        5800
      ],
      "size": [
        1090,
        190
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 77,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Run Strategy",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Queue strategy: Auto-Queue now handles scene iteration in Auto-Increment mode.\nIf Auto-Queue is disabled, keep queueing until `remaining_scenes` reaches 0.\nFor lyric-driven context, paste full lyrics into Screenwriter `raw_lyrics_override`.\nDirector default uses `use_prompt_template=False` for richer scene prompts.\nSet `use_prompt_template=True` only for fast deterministic fallback.\nEnable Director `enable_visual_metaphors` only if you want extra per-scene LLM passes (slow).\nScriptSupervisor is bypassed by default (mode 4) for speed; enable it manually for continuity QA.\nIf `whisperx` is not installed, Screenwriter auto-falls back to timing-map segmentation from `raw_lyrics_override`.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#243",
      "bgcolor": "#365"
    },
    {
      "id": 337,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -3120,
        5320
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 78,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Mode Presets (Music / Movie / Cartoon)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Local LTX-2 Mode Presets (PGFX)\n\n### Music Video Generator Emulation\n- SoundEngineer profile: `Music Only (No VAD/Emotion)`\n- Cinematographer mode: `Auto-Increment`\n- Keep shot durations dynamic from TIMING_MAP + num_frames\n\n### AI Movie Maker Emulation\n- SoundEngineer profile: `Dialogue/Podcast (VAD Focus)` or `Default (4s Scenes, VAD)`\n- Use longer scene segmentation and stronger narrative prompts in Director\n- Keep PostMaster stitching enabled for one continuous final render\n\n### Cartoon Video Maker Emulation\n- Keep local LTX-2 model path unchanged\n- Use Director `manual_styles_override` with toon/cel-shaded style terms\n- Keep negative prompt strict to avoid photoreal drift\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
